pg", "authorFollowers": 621006, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 261, "retweetCount": 12, "replyCount": 36, "quoteCount": 2, "viewCount": 36258, "bookmarkCount": 9, "createdAt": "2026-09-15T20:05:51+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/Mr_Derivatives/status/2099952857596477652"}, {"id": "2099952657926410693", "text": "$SPX keeps trading along the lower band which puts it in effect in a downtrend despite not closing below the lower band yet. The FOMC tomorrow should help send it to the next downside target which is the 100 day MA(now at 7506). I expect it to be hit either this week or the next. https://t.co/Ltc0Tvfvv8", "authorName": "CyclesFan", "authorUsername": "CyclesFan", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1347931014799228929/pEPrEmX7_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 59159, "authorVerified": false, "likeCount": 86, "retweetCount": 4, "replyCount": 12, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 6281, "bookmarkCount": 15, "createdAt": "2026-09-15T20:05:03+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/CyclesFan/status/2099952657926410693"}, {"id": "2099951485819756602", "text": "Three tickers dominating US options flow. Sep 15 · midday.\n\n- $PANW: calls, $39M, 23 unusual.\n- $QQQ: puts, $844M, 269 unusual.\n- $NFLX: puts, $39M, 17 unusual.\n\nDetail per name in thread. https://t.co/9nTWbGVO3h", "authorName": "Crossvol", "authorUsername": "crossvol_x", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053856042514014208/rPsmtf2u_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 346, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 57, "retweetCount": 4, "replyCount": 2, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 3646, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-09-15T20:00:24+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/crossvol_x/status/2099951485819756602"}, {"id": "2099947095268676003", "text": "Trade early morning and avoid most of the chop. The secret to today’s success.\nThank you $SPY ❤️ https://t.co/wDZ8szQ28i", "authorNa